# Keep checkout line endings identical on every host.
#
# The generated TypeScript project files (scripts/sync-typescript-projects.mjs)
# and several tests that read source text compare exact content. On a Windows
# hosted runner with the default `core.autocrlf` behaviour, the first R4-A-H run
# checked these files out with CRLF: check:repo reported every generated tsconfig
# as stale, and a source-reading assertion in checkpoint-recovery-state.test.ts
# failed. Git attributes take precedence over core.autocrlf, so forcing LF here
# makes hosted and local checkouts byte-identical for text files.
* text=auto eol=lf
